## Classes

This is an example of how html is rendered. With the following options you can change almost every class the way you want


```html
<div class="owl-carousel owl-theme owl-loaded">
    <div class="owl-stage-outer">
        <div class="owl-stage">
            <div class="owl-item">...</div>
            <div class="owl-item">...</div>
            <div class="owl-item">...</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="owl-nav">
        <button type="button" class="owl-prev">prev</button>
        <button type="button" class="owl-next">next</button>
    </div>
    <div class="owl-dots">
        <button type="button" class="owl-dot active" aria-label="Go to slide 1" aria-current="true"><span></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="owl-dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"><span></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="owl-dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"><span></span></button>
    </div>
</div>
```
